Great!  Thanks to your collective efforts, I think I now understand why
le, lo and la kandygu'e can be ok.........however, what about  "la
kadnygug. cu lamji la mergug" ? Surely "kadnygug" is not valid.  Doesn't
CLL state that a CVC rafsi cannot be at the end of a word?

=20

- Andrew

----- Original Message ----
